{"id":559,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It protects itself with its durable skin. It’s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It stretches its saggy skin up to its neck to protect itself. The saggier their skin, the more respect they garner."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They move in small groups, walking around lazily. Anyone who makes eye contact gets smacked with a headbutt."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck."},{"games":["White"],"text":"It immediately headbutts anyone that makes eye contact with it. Its skull is massively thick."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":559,"name":"Scraggy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":560,"name":"Scrafty","condition":"Lv. 39","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,43],[1,67],[4,371],[8,29],[12,28],[16,263],[20,259],[24,251],[28,184],[32,280],[36,207],[40,242],[44,136],[48,264],[52,457]],"machine":[491,133,280,339,370,811,242,174,